LOCATION:Lunasol
DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: $65.00 per person\nStatus: Waitl
 ist Only\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/180907\n\nSte
 p into a lively Saturday brunch designed for members 40 and under—where 
 new connections come easily and conversation flows as freely as the mimosa
 s. This Serendipity Brunch invites you to gather in Lunasol for a spirited
 \, social start to the day alongside fellow members.\n\nThe experience unf
 olds with a relaxed\, upbeat rhythm: a thoughtfully curated\, family-style
  menu paired with a playful deck of conversation prompts to spark connecti
 on and keep the dialogue engaging. Expect a table filled with pastries\, f
 ruit\, and parfaits to begin\, followed by your choice of entrée and gene
 rous sides\, with Bloody Marys and mimosas available throughout.\n\nIt’s
  a fresh\, convivial take on brunch at The ’House—effortless\, engagin
 g\, and just the right amount of serendipitous.\n\n*Tickets are $65 per pe
 rson\, plus tax\, and are reserved for members only. Cancellations within 
 48 hours of the event\, or failure to attend\, will be charged in full. Pl
 ease inform us of any dietary needs or restrictions by emailing happening@
 thequin.com at least 72 hours prior to the event.
