LOCATION:Bondo
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: $35.00 per person\nAvailability:
  46 spots left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse
 .com/events/182099\n\n11:30AM Lunch\, 12:00PM Discussion \n\nJoin us for 
 the final installment of our four-part series\, Women\, Worth & Wisdom\, l
 ed by Colette Phillips\, founder of Get Konnected. This culminating conver
 sation brings the next generation of female leaders to the forefront—spo
 tlighting voices across sectors who are shaping the future with intention 
 and impact.\n\nFeaturing Rachel Flor\, Executive Director of the JFK Libra
 ry Foundation\, Julia Johannsen\, Founder & CEO of The Impact Collective\,
  Zykera Steward\, Chief of Staff at Get Konnected! and The GK Fund\, and C
 herina D. Wright\, Esq.\, Assistant Vice President of Student Affairs at S
 uffolk University\, the panel will explore how today’s emerging leaders 
 are defining success\, prioritizing purpose\, and driving meaningful chang
 e in their work.\n\nTogether\, they will reflect on the mentors and moment
 s that shaped their paths\, while sharing how they aim to pay it forward�
 �creating space and opportunity for those just beginning their careers. En
 gaging and open in spirit\, the afternoon invites connection\, reflection\
 , and dialogue among peers.\n\n*This event is offered at $35 per person\, 
 plus tax\, to account for the buffet lunch\, enjoyed during the program. R
 eservations are open to members\, plus one guest. Cancellations made withi
 n 48 hours of the event are subject to a full charge.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/182099
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Chat
END:VEVENT
