DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: $65.00 per person\nAvailability:
  17 spots left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse
 .com/events/182101\n\nStep into a lively Saturday brunch designed for memb
 ers in their 40s - where meaningful connections come naturally and convers
 ation flows as effortlessly as the mimosas. This Serendipity Brunch invite
 s you to gather in Lunasol for a relaxed yet engaging start to the day alo
 ngside fellow members.\n\nThe experience unfolds at an easy\, social pace:
  a thoughtfully curated\, family-style menu paired with subtle conversatio
 n prompts to spark connection and keep dialogue flowing. Enjoy a table of 
 pastries\, fresh fruit\, and parfaits to begin\, followed by your choice o
 f entrée and generous sides\, with Bloody Marys and mimosas available thr
 oughout.\n\nIt’s a refined\, convivial take on brunch at The ’House—
 welcoming\, engaging\, and designed to bring together those who appreciate
