UID:quin-event-169178@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260519T130000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260519T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260519T150000
SUMMARY: 90 Minutes of Innovation: Leadership\, Governance and the Long Vie
 w 
LOCATION:The Pub
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 100 spots le
 ft\nStatus: futureSale\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events
 /169178\n\n1:00PM Program\, 2:30PM Networking\nWhat does it take to guide 
 institutions\, advise CEOs\, and shape strategy at the highest levels acro
 ss decades of transformation?\n\nIn the latest edition of 90 Minutes of In
 novation*\, John Werner—venture capitalist\, MIT lecturer\, and *Forbes*
  AI columnist—sits down with David Mussafer\, Chairman of Advent Interna
 tional and one of the most influential leaders in global private equity.\
 n\nWith a career spanning decades\, Mussafer has helped build Advent into�
 �one of the world’s top ten private equity firms\, headquartered here in
  Boston\, while also advising companies and serving on boards across indus
 tries. Drawing from the arc of his life’s work\, the conversation will 
 weave together personal insights and professional milestones\, offering a
  perspective that sits at the intersection of capital\, governance\, and l
 ong-term value creation—where the biggest decisions are often the least 
 visible.\n\nTogether\, they will explore what great companies and leadersh
 ip teams have in common\, how boards actually function—and how they must
  evolve—the role of private equity in building\, not just acquiring\, co
 mpanies\, and how leaders navigate uncertainty\, cycles\, and long-term st
 rategy. The conversation will also draw on lessons from decades of investi
 ng across sectors and geographies.\n\nExpect a thoughtful\, behind-the-sce
 nes conversation about how decisions get made at the highest levels—wher
 e governance meets growth\, and strategy meets execution.\n\nFrom boardroo
 ms to global markets—one stage\, one conversation\, not to be missed.\n\
 n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members only. Light bites a
 nd refreshments will be served.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/169178
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Chat
END:VEVENT
